,status,resolved_at_ms,failure_code,guards_passed_json,lease_id,coverage_epoch`. Require `status='confirmed'`, non-null resolved/lease, null failure, and expected empty guard list. Correlate the same requestId with safe `companion.answer.intake`/confirmed log metadata if available. A v3 confirmed status proves the acknowledged writer completed plus durable write/readback; protocol-v2 is required to stay `unconfirmed`. Then replay status only (not answer) to verify persistence. Do not resend the answer.\n\nNo answer was executed and no files were edited.\n</agent-message>"}
