{"parentUuid":"00c7eb33-c775-44e4-9553-83787dd986a1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"44611460-2829-462e-b2e9-af8e653be0db","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_h18zbDeou14j3A5pnNqiw0qe","type":"tool_result","content":"<retrieval_status>timeout</retrieval_status>\n\n<task_id>a98ebbe975bf745f7</task_id>\n\n<task_type>local_agent</task_type>\n\n<status>running</status>"}]},"uuid":"b2e603ee-0147-4a9a-b6d8-01395345a53d","timestamp":"2026-08-12T13:36:16.033Z","toolUseResult":{"retrieval_status":"timeout","task":{"task_id":"a98ebbe975bf745f7","task_type":"local_agent","status":"running","description":"Fix verified race defects","output":"","prompt":"Fix the two verified review defects in the shared working tree, building on pushed commits 408ecc9c5 + 5bc2dd144. 1) Zero-write classification: any unexpected failure while durable row is still `claimed` must record `failed` (non-fencing), regardless of error class; only `in_flight` can become `unconfirmed`. Ensure inner beginWrite failures don't first write unconfirmed. Add tests with throwing beginWrite/non-Sealed pre-write fault proving fresh request can retry/type; preserve ambiguous post-promotion behavior. 2) PostToolUse-before-mark remote provenance: actual createNotifyingCaptureSink can publish desktop question.resolved before answer marks remote provenance; late mark currently mutates only memory. Implement a corrective or deferred event mechanism so connected clients ultimately receive exact phone/watch provenance, without delaying/vetoing answer writes or settlement. Test through the notifying sink/event publisher race, not bare store mutation. No answer barriers. Keep wire status union four statuses. Run focused/full companion tests, scoped Biome, REFERR relevant. Do not commit. Report exact behavior/files.","result":"","isRawTranscript":true}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"00c7eb33-c775-44e4-9553-83787dd986a1","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","