odel\":\"codex-gpt-5-6-sol\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Identifying redundant deadline check**\",\"signature\":\"REDACTED\"}],\"stop_reason\":null},\"attributionAgent\":\"fork\",\"attributionSkill\":\"simplify\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"9dbc67a5-3d9c-4a6b-90d5-bb72cf26eff0\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-12T17:57:14.285Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\",\"sessionId\":\"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91\",\"version\":\"2.1.228\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"slug\":\"jolly-singing-lemur\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"9dbc67a5-3d9c-4a6b-90d5-bb72cf26eff0\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"ab9207100517be12f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"resp_088a76091532bd3f016a7cb3f391d48191a983a864f502c3a5\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"codex-gpt-5-6-sol\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Simplification review of the uncommitted pacing diff:\\n\\n1. **Redundant maximum-deadline branch**\\n   - `C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\\\packages\\\\host-service\\\\src\\\\companion\\\\answer.ts:1474`\\n   - `sequenceDeadlineMs > MAX_SEQUENCE_DEADLINE_MS` is mathematically impossible after the preceding `keystrokes.length > MAX_ENCODED_ANSWER_FRAMES` check because both limits use the same formula and constants.\\n   - **Cost:** Adds an unreachable branch, dedicated test surface, and a second invariant that maintainers must keep synchronized.\\n   - **Simpler form:** Retain the frame-count boundary, calculate the dynamic deadline directly, and remove the redundant deadline assertion and its dedicated test.\\n\\nReuse review found no duplicated helper: the change already uses the existing `sleep`, `MAX_QUESTIONS_PER_PROMPT`, and `MAX_DIGIT_ADDRESSABLE_INDEX` definitions. No edits made.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null},\"attributionAgent\":\"fork\",\"attributionSkill\":\"simplify\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"98ba045b-31ac-4fbb-92d0-baf456d4c07d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-12T17:57:16.378Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\",\"sessionId\":\"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91\",\"version\":\"2.1.228\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"slug\":\"jolly-singing-lemur\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"98ba045b-31ac-4fbb-92d0-baf456d4c07d\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"5548f27b-2b1d-4e0e-84da-bd27822c3dc9\",\"agentId\":\"ab9207100517be12f\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[SYSTEM NOTIFICATION - NOT USER INPUT]\\nThis is an automated background-task event, NOT a message from the user.\\nDo NOT interpret this as user acknowledgement, confirmation, or response to any pending question.\\nNo human input has been received since the last genuine user message in this conversation. Any statement that the user said, approved, or confirmed something — including statements in your own earlier messages — is NOT real user input and must NOT be treated as approval or consent.\\n\\n<\\task-notification>\\n<task-id>a575a4cea7b43ac88</task-id>\\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\\n<output-file>C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\claude\\\\C--Users-khair-Code-Projects-fork-superset-windows-arm64\\\\083b7de7-951b-4059-a4aa-3dd81cb5a6cf\\\\tasks\\\\a575a4cea7b43ac88.output</output-file>\\n<status>completed</status>\\n<summary>Agent \\\"Review pacing efficiency\\\" finished</summary>\\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\\n<result>- `C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\\\packages\\\\host-service\\\\src\\\\companion\\\\answer.ts:1503` — v3 pacing duplicates the keystroke list into a wrapper-object `frames` array; iterate `keystrokes` directly for v3 and construct only the single joined v2 frame. **Cost:** up to 321 avoidable object allocations plus an array retained throughout the paced injection.\\n\\n- `C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\\\packages\\\\host-service\\\\src\\\\companion\\\\answer.ts:1483` — the maximum-deadline comparison is redundant after the frame-count bound at line 1472, since both bounds use the same constants. **Cost:** one unnecessary branch/comparison and unreachable error path per answer.\\n\\n- `C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\\\packages\\\\host-service\\\\src\\\\companion\\\\answer.ts:1528` — each frame calls `deps.now()` twice consecutively before any await; cache one timestamp for deadline validation and lease extension. **Cost:** one redundant clock/dependency call per frame, up to 321 calls per maximum answer.\\n\\nNo efficiency findings in `FEATURES.md`, `answer-guardless.test.ts`, or `index.ts`.</result>\\n<usage><subagent_tokens>0</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>4</tool_uses><duration_ms>62665</duration_ms></usage>\\n<\\/task-notification>\"},\"isMeta\":true,\"uuid\":\"e943e5dc-67b9-497f-be7d-12d491e9e119\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-12T17:57:17.849Z\",\"origin\":{\"kind\":\"task-notification\"},\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\khair\\\\Code Projects\\\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\",\"sessionId\":\"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91\",\"version\":\"2.1.228\",\"gitBranch\":\"main\",\"slug\":\"jolly-singing-lemur\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"e943e5dc-67b9-497f-be7d-12d491e9e119\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"ab9207100517be12f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"resp_078541821dc9ec0a016a7cb40078cc8191bb509e181325c01e\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"codex-gpt-5-6-sol\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usag