{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"remove","timestamp":"2026-08-12T17:57:54.868Z","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","content":"<agent-message from=\"fork\">\nLate altitude result: answer.ts:350 reconstructs the encoder’s maximum legal frame count from picker-specific limits. Prefer encoder-owned sequence plan (validated frames + execution budget), or minimally export the frame bound from keystrokes.ts. Otherwise picker grammar/encoding changes require synchronized non-obvious formula and numeric tests in answer.ts, risking drift.\n</agent-message>"}
