{"parentUuid":"50c80df7-8871-4f06-a5f1-b15421a15ead","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"resp_08ad76fbe6e0967d016a7cc25801c88191bdf65fef791899c2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"codex-gpt-5-6-sol","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1956,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":252672,"output_tokens":797,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"It is yellow incorrectly.\n\nThe live dot decision shows:\n\n- **One real shell monitor:** `bpag95thf` — this should produce **blue**.\n- **Four completed agent entries** are still reported by Claude’s `background_tasks[]` as `type: \"teammate\", status: \"running\"`.\n- The hook could not map those four entries’ truncated task descriptions to their named agents’ `idle_notification` records, so it retained them in the safe-yellow direction.\n- Yellow has higher precedence than blue, so those stale teammate entries mask the legitimate blue shell state.\n\nThe faulty decision is recorded in:\n\n`C:\\Users\\khair\\.superset\\logs\\dot-decisions.log:74`\n\nThe individual failed matches are recorded in:\n\n`C:\\Users\\khair\\.superset\\logs\\teammate-idle-debug.log:16` through `:19`\n\nThe responsible matching logic is:\n\n`C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\apps\\desktop\\src\\main\\lib\\agent-jsonl-watcher\\pane-map-hook.ts:1194`\n\nSo this is **not the shell being assigned yellow**. It is a stale-agent reconciliation defect: four finished agents remain yellow and override the shell’s correct blue signal. No code was changed during this diagnosis."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"32a2d41d-f742-417f-bc0a-eb36debc05d0","timestamp":"2026-08-12T18:58:49.662Z","eff