ume finished\"."}],"multiSelect":false}],"answers":{"The names live on your PC, not in the push. If the phone can't reach the PC the moment an alert lands, what should it do?":"how can it not be embedded in the notification?","Should the watch show the full context or a compact version?":"Same as phone (Recommended)"},"annotations":{}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"87fab3ce-bb7b-4718-952b-4f19eecc9c8d","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
