{"parentUuid":"64cc0dcf-7434-42a4-892e-156dffae5834","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5d26gSap4TumdtvPMu6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"First architect verdict (Fable) is in: plan skeleton sound, six load-bearing corrections — the most important being per-(version, kind) push key sets (one v3 set can't serve questions and lifecycle), retract-branch placement on the phone, claim semantics on retract (claim, don't release), and a retraction-storm guard (a `retracted` state so repeated progress events fire exactly one retraction). It also resolved all open items — notably: no desktop-main hop needed at all (renderer already talks tRPC directly to host-service and owns the tab→terminal mapping), and the phone app is built locally via Gradle with both apps signed by the same key.\n\nHolding reconciliation until Opus and Sol report, then I'll fold the union of corrections into the plan."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3997,"cache_read_input_tokens":106506,"output_tokens":308,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":59},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3997,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":106506,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3997},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cbf4be4a-f754-440b-8a5b-b7067f1d5bff","timestamp":"2026-08-16T02:15:46.323Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.