{"parentUuid":"c385858a-84cd-49c9-8029-00f2359bebc9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5pjpGRT9jctKbAwmprH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019tqnQ4jTqZrz3hjdyPNjcy","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Final verification round — 5 round-2 fixes applied in the fork worktree. Verify ONLY these, CONFIRMED-RESOLVED / NEW-DEFECT each:\n1. resyncAgentStatus repair eligibility now from durable facts: seenAt>=row.lastEventAt + pure resolveV2AgentStatusTransition(targetVisible:false, empty statuses) — check the visible-pane scenario now repairs and no new false-positive class opened.\n2. companionAlertSync: state.desired + argument-less scheduleReadinessRetry reading desired at fire time; retry cancellation on newer-queued/equal-sentHash/host-change/reconnect/release; sentHash recorded only when the completed send is still current intent. Check no ordering window remains (A rejected → B queued mid-flight → A completes, etc.).\n3. HostNotificationSubscriber: layout-keyed effect on [workspacesById] runs syncAlertContexts + title-listener subscription; register/release stays on [workspaceIds, hostUrl]. Check new terminals get listeners, no re-introduced churn/release-on-tick.\n4. lifecycle-alerts markLifecycleSeen proof-of-absence: startedAtMs recorded at construction; null findLiveReadyAlert + startedAtMs<=seenThroughAt → silent return; host started after seenThroughAt still broadcasts blind. Check the evictOldest edge noted in the comment and that a real retraction can't be swallowed.\n5. Repair cooldown skip-set (REPAIR_COOLDOWN_MS 30min, keyed hostUrl:terminalId, bounded 512, doesn't spend the cap) + truthful comments + alertContexts privacy-rationale rewrite (behavior unchanged, test uses secret-project-plan.ts).\nWorktree: C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\.claude\\worktrees\\agent-a4b4acd04792ec9a3. FIX-FIRST only if something genuinely blocks.","summary":"Final verification of round-2 fixes","to":"rev-opus","type":"message","recipient":"rev-opus","content":"Final verification round — 5 round-2 fixes applie…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2441,"cache_read_input_tokens":204946,"output_tokens":1744,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":82},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1744,"cache_read_input_tokens":204946,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5e4db7ac-1f33-4a9b-b64a-53942b5eb242","timestamp":"2026-08-16T04:49:34.733Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
