{"parentUuid":"ca7b3192-912e-4ae1-b537-6cee17fc6b38","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5s6QQ3NbCUMbT8MULwT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NBB8LzYS8io4MEStgWm5w9","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Round-3 fixes applied for all 4 of your MAJORs + both MINORs (incl. Opus's). Verify ONLY these six, final verdict SHIP or FIX-FIRST:\n1. Listener/pane-id: new non-creating terminalRuntimeRegistry.hasInstance + collectTerminalPaneRefs; GetTerminalTitle takes (terminalId, paneId); subscribeTerminalTitleListeners subscribes exact pairs, no path creates a registry entry. New terminalTitleListeners.test.ts (10 tests incl. never-addresses-nonexistent-runtime, exact-pair, sibling-instance-doesn't-authorize).\n2. Equal-hash fast path now requires quiet workspace (pending===null && timer===null && inFlight===0); accepted completions whose hash ≠ current desired clear sentHash AND enqueue desired. A/C inversion is a regression test failing against old code (companionAlertSync.test.ts, 18 tests).\n3. Proof-of-absence latches unexpiredEvictionAtMs (any state) and requires it null; evictOldest logs every unexpired eviction with id+state; comments rewritten. 3 new tests: evicted-sent, sending-evicted-then-accepted, proof-disabled-after-eviction.\n4. reportTerminalSeen returns Promise<boolean> (never rejects); cooldown recorded only on resolution — accepted → 30min, rejected/transport-failure → 60s retry cooldown. resyncAgentStatus.test.ts (13 tests incl. rotation across epochs, cooldown distinctions).\n5. Cooldown map trimmed oldest-first to exported MAX_REPAIR_COOLDOWN_ENTRIES=512 after age pruning.\n6. Synthetic permission statuses entry when row.pendingPermission===true; null (unreadable markers) documented as wider set, contained by 3.\nWorktree: C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\.claude\\worktrees\\agent-a4b4acd04792ec9a3. Suite state: host companion 345/345, ren