{"parentUuid":"275f35a6-38fd-4c07-8b29-86923fdfaafe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5sSf8sJgniBDsUb4oeT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HA1Ndny66MDm5mWV75Nv2B","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"One remaining MAJOR from Sol's round-3 verification (items 2-6 confirmed resolved; item 1's pane-key fix confirmed but its lifecycle is incomplete):\n\nterminalTitleListeners.ts:54 — a terminal pane whose exact runtime doesn't exist during layout reconciliation is skipped PERMANENTLY. Render order makes this the common case: AuthenticatedLayout renders V2NotificationController before Outlet (layout.tsx:292-296), so on the commit that adds a new pane the subscriber's layout effect runs first, hasInstance(terminalId,paneId) is false, the pair is skipped — and the later TerminalPane effect (TerminalPane.tsx:157) that creates the runtime doesn't change workspacesById and the registry has no instance-created observer. No title listener is ever installed for the new terminal absent an unrelated layout tick.\n\nFix: add a NON-CREATING instance-availability notification to terminalRuntimeRegistry (e.g. onInstanceRegistered(cb) firing on entry creation/registration) and have listener reconciliation subscribe pending exact pairs when their instance appears, then fire the context sync. Keep the no-default-entry guarantee. Test the exact sequence: pair absent at layout reconciliation → instance created WITHOUT any layout change → exact title listener installed → sync fired. Also: Sol counted 9 tests in terminalTitleListeners.test.ts vs your reported 10 — reconcile the count while you're in there.\n\nThen rerun: renderer suites, host companion suite, lint, marker gate. Report per usual.","summary":"Dispatch final listener-lifecycle fix","to":"a4b4acd04792ec9a3","type":"message","recipient":"a4b4acd04792ec9a3","content":"One remaining MAJOR from Sol's round-3 verificati…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":223433,"output_tokens":828,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":88},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1109,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":223433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1109},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b79ebf04-a44f-41ac-8c97-ab29598cea7e","timestamp":"2026-08-16T05:25:00.932Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
