{"parentUuid":"82e4576f-5070-4850-808a-e9f4c04a0185","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5tLxvPneANx8KV2HMfz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sol found one more lifecycle hole in the same helper — a runtime that was present at reconciliation, later parked/deleted by the registry cap, and then recreated on workspace reopen never gets re-subscribed. Dispatching:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1031,"cache_read_input_tokens":228654,"output_tokens":871,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":90},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1031,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":871,"cache_read_input_tokens":228654,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1031,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1031},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7aa0a3b2-5ce8-46e7-a0d1-90661920a392","timestamp":"2026-08-16T05:36:43.079Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"7aa0a3b2-5ce8-46e7-a0d1-90661920a392","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5tLxvPneANx8KV2HMfz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014GTgvwpvKBCkKrheR8Nv1u","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Sol verdict on the listener fix: the first-registration sequence is confirmed fixed, but one MAJOR remains in the same helper:\n\nterminalTitleListeners.ts:75 — you track only pairs missing at INITIAL reconciliation. An initially-PRESENT pair is subscribed once and never enters pending; if all pairs are present no onInstanceRegistered observer exists at all. But the parked-runtime cap later calls disposeEntry → deleteEntry (terminal-runtime-registry.ts:433-449,486-497) and disposeTransport clears the entry's title listeners (terminal-ws-transport.ts:1010-1016) while the pane stays in the persisted layout. Reopening the workspace recreates the exact pair and DOES emit onInstanceRegistered — but your helper has no observer (or dropped the pair from pending after first install). The recreated transport never gets a listener, its title never re-syncs, no layout change occurs.\n\nAlso: your \"remount single-subscription\" test doesn't model this — it announces the same still-existing fake pair twice, but real getOrCreateEntry returns early (:139) WITHOUT announcing an existing pair; real recreation requires delete-then-create.\n\nFix per Sol: keep the FULL desired-pair set and an instance-registration observer alive for the whole subscription lifetime; on every creation announcement for a desired pair, install/REPLACE that pair's exact title listener and fire the sync. Make the fake registry model delete-then-recreate honestly (no announcement for existing pairs). Required regression test: initially-present → registry deletion/transport-listener-clear → exact recreation with no layout change → listener reinstalled + sync fired.\n\nRerun renderer + host suites, lint, marker gate. Report.","summary":"Dispatch recreation-lifecycle listener fix","to":"a4b4acd04792ec9a3","type":"message","recipient":"a4b4acd04792ec9a3","content":"Sol verdict on the listener fix: the first-regist…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1031,"cache_read_input_tokens":228654,"output_tokens":871,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":90},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1031,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":871,"cache_read_input_tokens":228654,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1031,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1031},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"31565ea2-41c3-4403-b5a5-37e7f9dd5046","timestamp":"2026-08-16T05:36:49.875Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
