{"parentUuid":"debc5e22-3d2c-42a7-a980-4c66ec241d7d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce5udWE8i9CgE43iGx1hv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012tQRXuUF2DpA7HUXCgfbEE","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"/simplify results for the companion repo — apply these. Rules: behavior identical, golden vectors byte-identical, full Gradle suite stays green (same 2 pre-existing env failures only); if an item breaks a real-behavior test, REVERT it and report skipped.\n\nAPPLY:\n1. AlertContext.kt isRenderable — compose SemanticText's existing walks instead of re-implementing: expose SemanticText.firstUnpairedSurrogate and firstControlChar as `internal`, call them, keep only the U+2028/U+2029 check local. Same sets, same walks — PushV3Test/golden vectors must not change.\n2. Ids.optionalOpaque16(value, field) shared helper (empty → \"\", else requireOpaque16); replace the triplicated t-parse in Push.kt:122-146, LifecyclePush.kt:112-133 and :186-204; drop the redundant requireOpaqueOrEmpty pre-check inside each (requireOpaque16 subsumes it for non-empty). Validation strictness unchanged.\n3. Move one expiry(data, label) helper into PushEnvelope beside `required`; delete the two private copies (Push.kt:149-155, LifecyclePush.kt:211-213). Drop the pure alias OPAQUE_KEYS_V3 = KEYS (use KEYS).\n4. AlertNotificationText.kt lifecycle() — select the (tabBody, plainBody) pair by kind, then one `if (context.namesTab)`; wording constants unchanged.\n\nSKIPPED (deliberate, do not do): shared string-list SharedPreferences store for PendingLifecycleDismissals + SeenLifecycleEvents — the tombstone store's semantics are verified-critical; consolidation risk outweighs the ~30 lines.\n\nThen rerun `./gradlew :core:test :app-phone:testDebugUnitTest :app-watch:testDebugUnitTest` and report per-item applied/reverted + final counts.","summary":"Apply simplify findings in companion repo","to":"impl-android","type":"me