{"parentUuid":"3139f6b0-80cd-4eaa-9ea4-018a271f4f59","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce6NLdenYGTcqJ6BAgPoW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NLP5BP77193D2DJAeSkuiK","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\tmp\\alert-context-names\\FINAL.md","old_string":"## 8. Accepted implementation deviations (post-review rulings)","new_string":"## 8. Accepted implementation deviations (post-review rulings)\n\n- **(ONE-BUZZ-UNTIL-READ, user-approved 2026-08-16, post-commit amendment):** a\n  repeat `g` finish for a chat whose finished-notification is still unread\n  REPLACES it silently (phone/watch key `g` notifications by terminal handle,\n  only-alert-once, ordering guard on `x`); reading the chat retracts and resets,\n  so the next finish buzzes fresh. Host: progress-supersede of a sent `g`\n  retires WITHOUT firing `c` (row kept); session-end and read still fire `c`.\n  `e` alerts keep per-event behavior. Trigger-timing invariant amended by\n  explicit user decision (evidence: 16 stacked buzzes overnight from one\n  orchestration chat on v0.1.0)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5572,"cache_read_input_tokens":310588,"output_tokens":473,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5572,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":310588,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5572,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5572},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b3dddaab-ba21-4837-89e3-1489666456c8","timestamp":"2