{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-16T12:53:54.757Z","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a91ec5448000b24ae</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01AMzzFm57UuBYPaTqya5vpa</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\khair\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-khair-Code-Projects-fork-superset-windows-arm64\\6e3543cc-ec14-446a-a214-ee9f89274f0a\\tasks\\a91ec5448000b24ae.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement sessions recycle bin\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Follow-up done. Rulings 1–3 noted; nothing reverted.\n\n## snoozeWorkspace fix (`useDashboardSidebarState.ts:648-700`)\n- Signature → `(workspaceId, until, projectId?: string | null)`.\n- Resolver **generalized and renamed**: `resolveSoftDeleteProjectId` → `resolveSidebarRowProjectId` (`sidebarMutations.ts:28-41`), now shared by `deleteWorkspace` (:801) and `snoozeWorkspace` (:672). Doc comment covers both lifecycle inserts.\n- Silent-no-op removed: the old `if (!resolvedProjectId) { error; return }` treated a legitimate null as unresolved, so a session (or any row whose host record carries no project) with no local-state row could never snooze. Null is now a resolved answer.\n- Fail-loud preserved, narrowed to the genuinely unresolvable case: `projectId === undefined &amp;&amp; hostWorkspace === null` → `console.error(\"[snoozeWorkspace] cannot snooze …: no local-state row, no host record and no projectId passed\")` + return. (SNOOZE-MAIN) insert path otherwise unchanged.\n- Test: `sidebarMutations.test.ts` — resolver describe renamed, plus a snooze-specific case (\"lets a project-less row snooze instead of refusing it\") documenting the exact regression the old `!resolvedProjectId` guard caused.\n\n## Re-run results\n- **Tests**: 161 pass / 1 fail across 19 files. Same single pre-existing failure (`removeProjectFromSidebarState &gt; clears the pin on a kept main-workspace row`), reproduced on clean main earlier — stale vs (REMOVE-STICKY).\n- **Biome**: 182 files checked, **0 diagnostics**.\n- **tsc**: **zero** diagnostics in any touched path and **zero** REFERR-class codes. `useDashboardSidebarWorkspaceItemActions.ts:166` TS2345 is now gone — both baseline errors in that file (166 snooze, 195 delete) are cleared. Remaining desktop-wide tsc noise is unrelated pre-existing/worktree-install artifacts (pty-daemon, route pages).\n- **Marker gate**: `All 156 feature markers present`.\n\n## Final change set\n25 files with content changes + 1 new dir (`hooks/useBulkWorkspaceSoftDelete/` — pure fn, hook, index, test). 8 files deleted (bulk hard-destroy stack). Nothing committed; worktree ready for review. Only accepted gap remains: no session-level \"Empty Recycle Bin\".</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>285314</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>15</tool_uses><duration_ms>192178</duration_ms></usage>\n<worktree><worktreePath>C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\.claude\\worktrees\\agent-a91ec5448000b24ae</worktreePath><worktreeBranch>worktree-agent-a91ec5448000b24ae</worktreeBranch></worktree>\n</task-notification>"}
