hown skip (claim consumed); cancel terminal-keyed on shown.gx<=c.gx (fixes your watch-relay-divergence scenario — test exists: retraction retires an older generation the relay never replaced); exact-event for e/event-keyed; gx on WatchLifecycleAlert+WatchLifecycleDismiss (defaults 0) + PendingLifecycleDismissals rows (short rows decode gx=0); PROTOCOL §13.5.1 gx-is-not-x normative + §13.5.6 honest residual (commit-fails-but-posts → at worst one extra buzz, never stuck). Suite 376 pass/2 pre-existing env. Golden refusals: g missing t, g missing gx, e carrying gx, c missing gx.\n\nProbe: standing-state escalation exactly-once across orderings; outstanding-record lifecycle (set/supersede/clear/restore) incl. no false reads from resync replay; gx monotonicity assumptions (same-terminal cycles have strictly increasing outcome instants — clock skew back-step?); cross-side golden agreement.","summary":"Queue one-buzz round-2 verification for Sol","to":"rev-sol","type":"message","recipient":"rev-sol","content":"After you finish the recycle-bin review: final ve…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":368936,"output_tokens":1443,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":229},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1443,"cache_read_input_tokens":368936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":540},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b75334c3-3c2e-4b47-96f4-1008a23fd9e7","timestamp":"2026-08-16T13:09:05.479Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\