{"parentUuid":"00abc992-5d9f-435e-b9f6-20ecc621be8f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce6V6nPa2xKjduLZhYn7F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sol found a genuine blocker Opus missed: the always-mounted remote `delete_workspace` agent-command tool still does a *physical* delete — kills terminals, removes the worktree and DB records, accepts main workspaces, leaves nothing to restore. Dispatching the full fix union:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1015,"cache_read_input_tokens":371564,"output_tokens":1431,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":235},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1431,"cache_read_input_tokens":371564,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"61ea904b-c60c-40f9-80a4-fc9a11f686da","timestamp":"2026-08-16T13:12:31.450Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"61ea904b-c60c-40f9-80a4-fc9a11f686da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce6V6nPa2xKjduLZhYn7F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KtZVntQmffFJtMgx3BatdF","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Review union on your worktree: 1 BLOCKER (Sol) + 3 MINORs (Opus). Fix all, rerun suites/lint/tsc/marker gate, report per-item.\n\n1. BLOCKER — AgentHooks remote tool delete-workspace.ts:27: the always-mounted `delete_workspace` remote command still calls the legacy PHYSICAL electronTrpc.workspaces.delete (kills terminals, removes worktree via git.ts:831-844, deletes DB records at delete.ts:328-332, no deletedAt, no Restore) and accepts MAIN workspace ids. Fix: route it through the same soft-delete path as the v2 UI — write the deletedAt tombstone via the sidebar soft-delete used by single rows, refuse/skip mains loudly in the tool result, no physical cleanup. Physical destroy remains only behind the in-bin permanent-delete flow. Add a test pinning that the tool soft-deletes and refuses mains.\n\n2. MINOR — bulkWorkspaceSoftDelete.ts:30: deleteWorkspace has a second refusal path (hostWorkspace===null || workspaceType==null at useDashboardSidebarState.ts:783-788) invisible to the bulk core, so a host-refused row is counted as deleted and deselected while it still sits in the active lane. Fix: deleteWorkspace returns boolean (false on both refusals); bulk pushes to softDeletedIds only on true; refused rows stay selected (the module's own stated contract). Update its tests.\n\n3. MINOR — session \"Delete permanently\" (useDashboardSidebarWorkspaceItemActions.ts:144 → workspaceCleanup.destroy): newly reachable for project-less sessions; the destroy contract (workspace-cleanup.ts:196-208) documents worktree/branch cases but nothing for a session with no worktree. TRACE the host destroy path in code for a session workspace (no worktree, no branch): if it handles it cleanly, add a test/pin and say so; if it would error or do something destructive-adjacent, drop \"Delete permanently\" from session bin rows (Restore + 30-day TTL only) and note it. Don't guess — read the host code.\n\n4. MINOR — archiveWorkspace (useDashboardSidebarState.ts:605) is the third lifecycle-insert sibling still on the old collapsing `projectId ?? host?.projectId` + falsy refusal, and RemoveFromSidebarMount.tsx:36 already feeds it `string | null` (a session with no local row silently fails to archive — same bug class). Widen to `projectId?: string | null` and route through resolveSidebarRowProjectId, matching delete/snooze. Add the matching test.\n\nReviewers verified sound (don't churn): bulk local soft-delete + main skip, dead stack removal, partition/restore/window, prefs heal, project-row X, in-bin permanent-delete flow.","summary":"Dispatch bin blocker + minors","to":"a91ec5448000b24ae","type":"message","recipient":"a91ec5448000b24ae","content":"Review union on your worktree: 1 BLOCKER (Sol) + …"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1015,"cache_read_input_tokens":371564,"output_tokens":1431,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":235},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1431,"cache_read_input_tokens":371564,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2fdbc23a-2c3a-4cb2-b962-edb000ad1759","timestamp":"2026-08-16T13:12:45.065Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
