{"parentUuid":"42185eb7-241b-4b53-b01c-48a65d46105d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce6VmV9aMFXzABMwBWxf1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gkwj52236RLceT97Q5tSCt","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Verification pass on the recycle-bin fix round (worktree agent-a91ec5448000b24ae, uncommitted). Verify these 4, verdict SHIP or FIX-FIRST. Note your Bash is broken (Sol hit it too) — use code reading + the agent's reported gate runs (tests 187/1-pre-existing, biome 0, tsc 0 in touched paths, markers 157); if you can run tools via other means, do.\n\n1. BLOCKER fix: tools/delete-workspace.ts loops ctx.softDeleteWorkspace(id) with per-id refusal reasons; ToolContext's deleteWorkspace MUTATION HANDLE REMOVED (type-enforced — no tool can reach electronTrpc.workspaces.delete); useCommandWatcher builds softDeleteWorkspace from useHostWorkspaces + useDashboardSidebarState().deleteWorkspace with refusals: unknown-on-device, main (\"archive-only\"), state-hook refusal; provider nesting verified (_authenticated/layout.tsx:281-290); 4 new tests incl. main-refused-loudly-while-rest-deleted and fake-ctx-compile-enforcement.\n2. deleteWorkspace returns boolean (false on both refusal paths); executeBulkWorkspaceSoftDelete returns {softDeletedIds, skippedMainIds, refusedIds}, only softDeletedIds reach onDeleted (refused rows stay selected); tests updated + refused-row case.\n3. Session \"Delete permanently\" KEPT after tracing host workspace-cleanup.ts end-to-end: sessions first-class (inspect:149 ignoreInitialCommit, runDestroy:299 preflight includes sessions, runDestroyPhases:465-489 rm only when isInsideSessionsRoot else warning+skip, failed rm throws and un-archives at :388-391, teardown/cloud/branch paths all skip sessions); pinned by existing upstream tests workspace-cleanup.test.ts:695 + :718. Verify this trace is accurate.\n4. archiveWorkspace widened to string|null via shared resolveSidebarRowProjectId, narrow fail-loud; RemoveFromSidebarMount session-archive now works; test added.\n\nAccepted residuals (don't flag): remote list_workspaces can't see deletedAt (idempotent re-delete, harmless); physical delete reachable only from two dead v1 screens (fork is v2-only); no new host-service test for the sessions-root guard (existing tests cover session destroy; host-service is frozen for this change).\n\nProbe: the softDeleteWorkspace closure's data sources (host list staleness vs refusal correctness), tool result truthfulness (recoverable:true only when true), any remaining compile path to the physical mutation from tools, bulk refusedIds not leaking into onDeleted.","summary":"Opus verify bin fix round","to":"rev-opus","type":"message","recipient":"rev-opus","content":"Verification pass on the recycle-bin fix round (w…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3186,"cache_read_input_tokens":374128,"output_tokens":1594,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":361},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1594,"cache_read_input_tokens":374128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3186},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9366a6ad-51a1-4c70-8a6e-2bff19f675fe","timestamp":"2026-08-16T13:21:36.330Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
