{"parentUuid":"d4734751-1908-489c-949b-6ffe16612e56","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce6YPs3w6dBYutVbNwGfk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FpWaLhETiSM15hmoxiNyqu","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Round-4 proof-epoch fix applied. Verify this one item only, final verdict SHIP or FIX-FIRST:\nlifecycle-alerts.ts — required dep proofEpochs (read once at construction from hostDb.listBindings(), no ended_at filter so ended sessions count); canProveAbsence = !proofDisabled && !hasEvictedUnexpired && startedAtMs<=seenThroughAt && (epoch===undefined ? !clockIsBehindPersistedTimeline : seenThroughAt>epoch). clockIsBehindPersistedTimeline = any persisted instant >= startedAtMs (backstep signature covers terminals with no surviving binding row). null/throwing epoch read → proof disabled, logged loudly, bridge still starts (blind c is the safe failure). 7 new tests incl. your exact restart-4000/A-5000/read-5000 → blind c(gx=5000), the held-5001 variant, per-terminal isolation, unknown-terminal both ways, seenThroughAt=5001 proof still claimed.\nSuite: host 394/0, markers 160, biome clean on touched dirs, renderer untouched this round.\nProbe: epoch snapshot taken once at construction vs bindings written AFTER manager start (no race that re-enables false proof); listBindings semantics (does it include all terminals that ever had instants?); conservative-failure paths.","summary":"Sol verdict on proof-epoch fix","to":"rev-sol","type":"message","recipient":"rev-sol","content":"Round-4 proof-epoch fix applied. Verify this one …"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2131,"cache_read_input_tokens":400980,"output_tokens":577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"e