et; independently recompute and compare every value. If actual BC behavior differs from the plan, message me and the desktop agent before adapting. Follow repo AGENTS/global rules, keep Entire enabled. Keep task #3 in_progress on unresolved failures; mark completed only when implementation/tests are done, then report files, dependency/version, tests, vectors, and deviations.","teammate_id":"companion-srp-opus@session-db223e0d","agent_id":"companion-srp-opus@session-db223e0d","agent_type":"general-purpose","model":"opus","name":"companion-srp-opus","color":"blue","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"session-db223e0d","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"23ea9b7c-1b25-4bac-a1a7-591462cb6594","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
