{"parentUuid":"434ff168-d84c-4276-a2fd-a9d7348a775c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"resp_0b730633bbc3655a016a82414d5674819193f51a45c2b43248","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"codex-gpt-5-6-sol","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1209,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":105984,"output_tokens":830,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_UZwQCFNsIyOjuu2kutOKWYqU","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"desktop-srp-opus","summary":"Resume desktop SRP implementation","message":"API limit reset. Resume task #2 now. Final decisions: use three-request stock-BC-compatible SRP flow and hostname `pair-superset.khaira.family` (single label, covered by existing TLS wildcard). Wire: POST begin {v:2,deviceId,label,surface,appVersion,protocol}->{v:2,pid,pairSalt,serverTimeMs}; POST kex {v:2,pid,deviceId,A}->{v:2,B,serverTimeMs}; POST confirm {v:2,pid,deviceId,macPhone}->sealed. Begin rate-capped/idempotent; candidate metadata created/validated there. Kex requires live candidate+pid, charge before A validation/modexp; 1<A<N-1; fresh b/B; derive keys/transcript then drop b/S; exact same A retry returns cached B, different A refuses first stands. Confirm charge then MAC. Public host pre-body allowlist has exactly begin/kex/confirm; main host 404s them and keeps JWT. Fail-closed host config. Apply all prior secret-zeroization, OpenSSL/native-modexp evaluation, route-matrix, bounds, vectors, marker, lint/type/test instructions. No commit/push. Coordinate constants/vectors with companion-srp-opus and report blockers immediately.","type":"message","recipient":"desktop-srp-opus","content":"API limit reset. Resume task #2 now. Final decisi…"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_de