e.ts`; dependency addition recorded in `gradle/libs.versions.toml` with a resolution date, matching the file's own stated convention.\n\nNot covered (state to the parent before shipping): all untracked SRP/handshake sources and their tests, and desktop diff lines ~700-8000 (host-service config/http/index/pairing/types, tRPC router).\n\n**FIX-FIRST** — on coverage, not on severity: the two findings above are MINOR, but the SRP implementation and 90% of the desktop diff were never read.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>120095</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>11</tool_uses><duration_ms>155201</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
