\n\nCost scenario: none. No recomputation exists → zero per-handshake work to remove. Both file and hot computation fabricated.\n\nEvidence: directory enumeration of companion dir; Read `pairing.ts:286-405` and `489-567`; scoped searches — `\\bsrp\\b|kex` over `host-service/src` returned only `limits.ts:93` doc text plus pairing kex identifiers; `modPow|PAD\\(|H\\(PAD|srp` over `packages` → no matches.\n\nCoverage: companion pairing/kex path, key schedule, kex caps/rate limiting, BigInt usage in `companion/`.\n\nTooling caveat: Bash nonfunctional this session (`/usr/bin/bash: -c: line 104: unexpected EOF while looking for matching `''` on every command incl. `echo ok`); repo-wide Glob times out at 20s. Verification done via Read + path-scoped Grep; `git log` unavailable, so a historically deleted `srp.ts` could not be ruled out — no reference survives in any tracked source, doc, or client file.\n\n**FIX-FIRST** on the candidate list itself: drop this entry (not a code change).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>31502</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>0</tool_uses><duration_ms>15392</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"8cf33ec3-81d6-4f8e-b6a3-217ebba61aa8","timestamp":"2026-08-17T12:30:37.937Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
