{"parentUuid":"a6adfe4a-0fd6-4b56-b320-216b60d23036","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Ce8TFnsrwsKRkECgaDxRy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V3ikmSpThUdrToB8PSsZFr","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64\\tmp\\pairing\\commit-msg-companion.txt","content":"feat(pairing): SRP-6a remote code pairing, no embedded Access token\n\nPhone half of (REMOTE-CODE-PAIRING), lockstep with the desktop fork.\nSRP-6a client over stock BouncyCastle (bcprov-jdk18on 1.85.2,\nlightweight API, never a JCE provider): the typed 8-digit code never\nleaves the phone; knowledge is proven only via macPhone at confirm.\n\n- three-request flow against https://pair-superset.khaira.family:\n  begin -> pid/pairSalt, stock generateClientCredentials -> A, kex ->\n  B (strict 1<B<N-1 on arrived 384 bytes, u!=0, never reduced),\n  calculateSecret -> fixed-width I2OSP(S,384) -> v3-srp HKDF schedule;\n  825-byte transcript; sealed step-4 under AAD /v1/pair/confirm with\n  frozen PROTOCOL_VERSION_AT_PAIRING=1 (never PROTOCOL_CURRENT)\n- Access token constants/headers deleted from the pairing client -\n  the PAKE plus TLS to the pinned host is the security boundary\n- Unicode decimal digits normalised to ASCII at entry (Arabic-Indic/\n  Devanagari/fullwidth keyboards no longer burn a valid window);\n  passwordBytes throws on any non-ASCII-digit\n- honest failure states: CONFIRM_UNVERIFIED for every post-confirm\n  defect (envelope, macDesktop, deviceId, gateway 5xx, unparsable) -\n  \"nothing was stored\" is claimed only when provably true;\n  pair_unknown_candidate -> user-triggered retained-code Try again;\n  429 terminal; no automatic retry at begin/kex/confirm\n  (retryOnConnectionFailure(false); one confirm per submit)\n- shared bounded 64KiB reply reads (remote + LAN), shared confirm\n  envelope opener, single PairingFailure.fromWire resolver, shared\n  process OkHttpClient, repository-level pairing single-flight mutex,\n  SRP/storage work off the main thread\n- frozen cross-runtime vectors reproduce the desktop TypeScript half\n  byte-for-byte; RFC 5054 Appendix B profile anchor; QR/LAN flow and\n  sc/v1 schedule byte-identical\n\ncore 231 tests (2 pre-existing env-gated differential-vector cases),\napp-phone 228, app-watch 10; PROTOCOL.md sections 4.9.x rewritten.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1110,"cache_read_input_tokens":373297,"output_tokens":996,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1110,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":996,"cache_read_input_tokens":373297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1110,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1110},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"3a92d72e-0d23-4129-8d32-9785477bc670","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:09:39.027Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
