to type \"allow pasting\": `type --text \"allow pasting\"`, then `key --combo \"enter\"`, then repeat step 6.\n8. Screenshot the Superset window to verify the overlay is GONE and normal app UI (sidebar/terminals) is visible. If the overlay is still there, take one more screenshot after 3 seconds and report honestly.\n9. Optionally close DevTools with `ctrl+shift+i` again ONLY if the overlay is confirmed gone.\n\nHARD CONSTRAINTS — violating these loses the user's live work:\n- NEVER close, quit, or restart Superset. Do not press Alt+F4, do not click any window close button, do not use the app's File>Quit.\n- NEVER click \"Download Manually\" or \"Check for Update\" in the overlay.\n- Do not click anything in the app UI other than DevTools surfaces and the console input.\n- sanctioned_irreversible: [] (none). If any irreversible-looking confirmation appears, STOP and report.\n\nSTOP AND REPORT (do not improvise) if: DevTools will not open, the console input cannot be located even by coordinates, or the paste is rejected twice.\n\nReturn: outcome (success|partial|failed|stopped), what the screen looked like BEFORE, what it looked like AFTER, whether the console reported \"kill-switch stubbed\", and any blocker. Keep it under 15 lines."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7504,"cache_read_input_tokens":451716,"output_tokens":1195,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7504,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1195,"cache_read_input_tokens":451716,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7504},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"attributionSkill":"windows-computer-us