{"parentUuid":"12992e6a-5193-4bcc-bb40-34051554324d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14987362 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"29148202-3b78-468b-9912-83b761f716ec","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:33:23.352Z","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"29148202-3b78-468b-9912-83b761f716ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8eErVQLovK4EZerdTwb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The permanent fix is committed (`9b5d2f7c4c`), pushed, and **build 32046108743** is running. When it lands I'll download the installer to Downloads and tell you.\n\nWhat that build changes: their notice API can still show you a message, but it can never blank your app, can never be un-dismissable, and can never offer a button that installs their build over your fork. `UpdateRequiredPage` is deleted from the fork entirely, so a future merge can't quietly re-wire it. Your own host-service version check is untouched — that one's legitimately yours.\n\nNow, your severance request needs a decision from you."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_read_input_tokens":474522,"output_tokens":942,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":402,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":942,"cache_read_input_tokens":474522,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":402},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8ea15cdd-961e-46e9-be9f-d0b6bc46b97a","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:33:34.097Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"8ea15cdd-961e-46e9-be9f-d0b6bc46b97a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8eErVQLovK4EZerdTwb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KmB33ZcKG9mfnjyHN1Ebxg","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"header":"Severance scope","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"description":"Kill analytics/PostHog, Sentry crash reporting, the notices poll and the upstream auto-update feed. Add a deny-by-default network fence in log-only mode first so I can prove nothing legitimate breaks. Keeps sign-in and workspace sync working. Low risk, ships fast.","label":"Phase 1 only: telemetry + phone-home (Recommended)"},{"description":"Phase 1, plus remove sign-in and mint a permanent local identity, plus move any cloud-backed data onto the local SQLite/host-service layer, then switch the fence to enforcing. Bigger job, and it means giving up cross-device sync, sharing, and remote hosts via their relay.","label":"Full severance, no sign-in"},{"description":"Do nothing further on severance for now; just keep the update-gate fix that's already building.","label":"Stop after the update fix"}],"question":"How far do you want the cloud severance to go? The architecture review says full severance is a data-plane migration, not just unplugging — no sign-in breaks the workspace-sync collections that are currently served through their cloud API, so those have to move onto local storage first."},{"header":"Accepted losses","multiSelect":true,"options":[{"description":"Workspaces/settings syncing between machines via their cloud. Confirm you don't rely on this.","label":"Cross-device sync"},{"description":"Sharing workspaces or sessions with anyone else through their cloud.","label":"Sharing with others"},{"description":"Connecting to remote hosts routed through Superset's relay service. Your own Cloudflare tunnel and companion pairing are unaffected either way.","label":"Remote hosts via their relay"},{"description":"I might use one of these — stop and check with me before cutting anything in this list.","label":"None of these — ask me first"}],"question":"If we go beyond Phase 1, these features go away by design. Which are you fine losing?"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_read_input_tokens":474522,"output_tokens":942,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":402,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":942,"cache_read_input_tokens":474522,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":402},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"90506568-bfe2-40ed-bd3e-b7d5693903da","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:33:44.097Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
