{"parentUuid":"143f77d1-0db7-43fb-8458-440f1a919e53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8ohQiffWVTPYALQ8FgJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That review earned its keep. The two significant ones:\n\n**The egress fence would have logged your browsing.** It exempts browser-pane traffic by identifying the webview — but a site running a service worker (any PWA) makes requests with no identifiable owner, so those origins fell through to \"unknown\" and got written to the log. A privacy tool quietly building a browsing-history file is precisely the failure worth catching before it ships.\n\n**The new gate was frozen, but its invocation wasn't.** The CI repair agent is explicitly told to prefer editing files under `.github/actions/` — so when the severance gate failed, it could simply have deleted the step that runs it and published anyway. Freezing the judge but not the summons is no freeze at all.\n\nBoth are being fixed, along with a false claim in the code comments, a dead command-palette entry, and a missing backstop on the notices poll."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2111,"cache_read_input_tokens":572503,"output_tokens":281,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2111,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":281,"cache_read_input_tokens":572503,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2111},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5d52c50c-a324-4ab8-a68b-42993d4fc5d2","timestamp":"2026-08-17T18:37:36.212Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","en