{"parentUuid":"209ea38e-6043-49f2-9cd7-81a29c29ba5b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8rRJMLTpuWzMhyrXyZz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your installer is ready.\n\n**`C:\\Users\\khair\\Downloads\\Superset-1.20.2-arm64.exe`** — 462 MB, published 19:09, SHA-256 `CA2D1088…C412`. (It replaced the earlier download, so there's only one file there — the right one.)\n\nWhat's in it:\n- Upstream's notice API can no longer blank your window. Blocking notices are downgraded to dismissible ones, `UpdateRequiredPage` is deleted from the fork, and any \"install this update\" button is stripped.\n- A malformed version field from their API can no longer crash the renderer — the hook doesn't read their version fields at all now.\n- Your own host-service version check is untouched.\n\n**Not** in it: the Phase 1 severance work and the network-logger fix. Those are still uncommitted while the CI-hardening fix lands, and they'll go in the next build.\n\nOne caveat worth knowing before you install: this is the same version number as what you're running, so you'll be replacing the app in place, and your terminals will die when it closes — same as any install."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":602,"cache_read_input_tokens":596574,"output_tokens":664,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":602,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":664,"cache_read_input_tokens":596574,"cache_creation_input_tokens":602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":602},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"1f832614-9580-4c5b-bce2-c53976c26ba1","timestamp":"2026-08-17T19:1