{"parentUuid":"f11fdb99-2f28-48ab-89b3-838390bde6db","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8tSvoL4SQYHY7jDscKo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It found a real hole in its own work and refused to give me the confirmation I asked for — the floor of \"≥10 assertions\" can be met by a build that never packaged anything, which is precisely the case it was meant to catch. Approving the fix."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_read_input_tokens":606288,"output_tokens":1160,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":167},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":606288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"16533589-6e3d-47af-9bae-a20b0c5375ca","timestamp":"2026-08-17T19:39:52.691Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"16533589-6e3d-47af-9bae-a20b0c5375ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8tSvoL4SQYHY7jDscKo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Nie81o1SUUmD4anjNhTZgw","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"GO on the fix, all three parts, exactly as you described:\n1. In full mode a missing apps/desktop/release is a FAILURE, not a note — same fail-vacuously rule as every other assertion.\n2. Raise the frozen workflow floor to >= 11 (same commit, since it edits the frozen workflow).\n3. Add --allow-unpackaged for local post-compile runs, stamping mode \"partial\"; the frozen workflow's mode === \"full\" requirement means that can never satisfy CI.\nGood catch, and the right call to refuse the confirmation rather than hand me a number that looked fine. A floor that a skipped-packaging run can satisfy is not a floor.\n\nVerify after applying: a full packaged run reports exactly 11 and passes; a run with release/ absent FAILS LOUD in full mode; --allow-unpackaged stamps \"partial\" and is rejected by the frozen step's mode check; and the stamp's assertion count still reflects assertions that actually executed.\n\nAlso noted and accepted: the nightly race. I will confirm no nightly-merge run is in flight, then commit workflow + composite action together in ONE commit, then dispatch from main. Nightly is 02:13 UTC and we are hours away, so timing is fine.\n\nA Fable review of this round is still running — it is specifically probing whether a repaired composite action can FORGE a valid stamp before the frozen step reads it, and whether the byte-identical step-block extraction can be defeated by renaming the step. If it lands findings there, they fold into the same commit. Apply the floor fix now and report; do not start anything else.","summary":"Approve assertion floor fix","to":"phase1-impl-opus","type":"message","recipient":"phase1-impl-opus","content":"GO on the fix, all three parts, exactly as you de…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_read_input_tokens":606288,"output_tokens":1160,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":167},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":606288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7c2a1c69-7576-44b4-916d-d8fafbde70db","timestamp":"2026-08-17T19:40:01.411Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
