{"parentUuid":"3c7db6e5-cca5-44b7-b880-69469db8e177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeAFXE4Tv5arhHsnZPLmp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Feeding the live process-tree evidence to the architect — it materially changes the design space."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":75861,"output_tokens":963,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":164},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":771,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":75861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":771},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"bd996ba0-b729-43bc-abfc-2af262748bc7","timestamp":"2026-08-18T12:56:46.389Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"bd996ba0-b729-43bc-abfc-2af262748bc7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeAFXE4Tv5arhHsnZPLmp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011FvrhzS4A6b6j3HxiQrqbT","name":"SendMessage","input":{"message":"Live evidence from the running installed build (v1.20.2) — feed this into your analysis, it may change the design space significantly.\n\nActual process tree observed on this machine (all started within 10s of app boot):\n  4876   Superset.exe  main\n  22764  gpu-process\n  22784  utility NetworkService (cors-schemes=superset-app)\n  23332  renderer --app-path=...\\resources\\app.asar\n  7340   terminal-host.js\n  5088   host-service.js            (child of main 4876)\n  25084  pty-daemon.js --socket=\\\\.\\pipe\\superset-ptyd-b3820f0679d3   (child of host-service 5088)\n\nSo there is ALREADY a separate pty-daemon process talking over a Windows named pipe, plus a distinct terminal-host.js. Key questions this raises, please answer concretely with file:line:\n1. What is pty-daemon.js, who spawns it, and with what options (detached? stdio? job object?) — find the spawn site and the socket/pipe naming scheme (the pipe name has a hex suffix — is it derived from a stable key, or random per boot? If random, reattach needs a discoverable handshake).\n2. Division of labour between terminal-host.js, host-service.js and pty-daemon.js. Which one actually owns the node-pty handles?\n3. Does pty-daemon already survive its parent dying (is it detached / does it have an idle-exit timer / does it exit when the pipe client disconnects)? If it already outlives host-service, the remaining work may be only: (a) stop killing it at app quit, (b) make the pipe name discoverable across app restarts, (c) reattach + replay scrollback on boot.\n4. Also note: host-service listens on TCP 127.0.0.1:47610 and the renderer dials http/ws 127.0.0.1:48056. Map which port belongs to which process and which one carries terminal I/O.\n\nRepository files + the installed app's own artifacts only — no user home-directory shell profiles or credentials.","summary":"Send live process-tree evidence to architect","to":"term-persist-explore-opus","type":"message","recipient":"term-persist-explore-opus","content":"Live evidence from the running installed build (v…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":75861,"output_tokens":963,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":164},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":771,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":75861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":771},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8856ebfc-64ed-472d-8733-65636bf667ae","timestamp":"2026-08-18T12:56:57.291Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
