{"parentUuid":"3b97fe82-6e8d-4e8d-a4ff-8943acdff541","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeAJW3PqbRAxUjuMs3RdJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8482,"cache_read_input_tokens":210004,"output_tokens":1083,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":379},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8482,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1083,"cache_read_input_tokens":210004,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8482,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8482},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9d85fc56-9c8f-4641-9ed0-6f1b8da63295","timestamp":"2026-08-18T13:35:52.893Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"9d85fc56-9c8f-4641-9ed0-6f1b8da63295","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeAJW3PqbRAxUjuMs3RdJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Terminal design is now fully specified with measured numbers rather than estimates. I extracted the daemon bundle from the shipped archive and read its actual dependency list.\n\n**The daemon's complete runtime closure:**\n\n| Component | Size |\n|---|---|\n| Electron runtime + locales | 344 MB |\n| `pty-daemon.js` | 42 KB |\n| Two shared chunks it requires | 12 KB |\n| `node-pty` + ConPTY native | 10.7 MB |\n| **Total** | **~355 MB** |\n\nAgainst **2.21 GB** for the originally-proposed whole-directory copy. The daemon requires only those two chunks plus `node-pty` and Node built-ins — nothing else.\n\nThree design questions resolved in the process:\n\n- **No path-remapping trick is needed.** An override for the daemon's script path already exists upstream. The real work is that the daemon's *executable* is the install directory's binary — so the fix must override the exe, the script path, and set an explicit working directory (currently it inherits one that can lock the install folder).\n- **The copy shouldn't happen in the app's main process.** The daemon already runs as Node and can read inside the archive, so the host-service can materialise the sidecar itself, lazily, before the first spawn. That structurally avoids the documented startup footgun where blocking file I/O leaves the window blank.\n- **Chunk filenames are hash-suffixed**, so nothing may hardcode them — that's the exact mistake that blocked three nightlies before.\n\n**The honest gate on all of this**: I still can't explain all 111 daemon respawns. The signal crash I found is real and confirmed, but only accounts for some. Until we know what causes the rest, relocating the daemon might not be sufficient — so the diagnosis has to come before the sidecar is built, not after. That test needs the app to quit, which ends this session, so your next install is the natural moment.\n\nBoth implementation agents are still running. Nothing committed yet.\n\nIncidentally, your `tmp/` folder holds about **1.7 GB of old installers** plus a 122 MB source tarball. Happy to clear those out if you want the space."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8482,"cache_read_input_tokens":210004,"output_tokens":1083,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":379},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8482,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1083,"cache_read_input_tokens":210004,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8482,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8482},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2049e94f-1d84-463f-ae56-d0c3349ab51f","timestamp":"2026-08-18T13:36:02.191Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
