es the child's setsid/login_tty (it may\r\n357-\t\t// still show the daemon's own pgid — collect's current-pgid guard\r\n358-\t\t// covers that — and no tty), so re-capture once the child has","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fe0649f6-0bf2-4415-92b3-2951b975efb3","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
