{"parentUuid":"f9b4cc69-d8c8-4ed1-816b-edb2337886c4","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"Goal: let terminals survive Superset reinstalls. I found and fixed a Windows crash that kills all sessions, plus CI hardening. Next: waiting on Fable's review of the terminal fix before committing anything. (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-08-18T14:04:30.931Z","uuid":"36883ea5-9a4b-48c8-a3e9-b5b398d66a13","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.234","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
